{"id":"n70871-1-8","stage":1,"title":"점점 · 越来越","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70871-1-8-1","ko":"요즘 저 배우가 광고에 많이 나오더라.","zh":"最近那个演员经常出现在广告里呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우가","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"광고에","meaning":"广告","explanation":"광고：广告；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"광고","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62390","senseId":"1","lemma":"광고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오더라.","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"3ac16375aaf1de63","term":"광고","zh":"广告","audio":"/audio/3ac16375aaf1de633847.mp3","entryId":"62390","definition":"通过电视或报纸等向人们广泛告知某些信息的宣传活动。","pronunciation":["광ː고"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c397880538e63c6f86c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70871-1-8-2","ko":"연기력을 인정받으면서 인기가 점점 올라가고 있어.","zh":"随着演技得到认可，他的人气也越来越高了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"연기력을","meaning":"演技","explanation":"연기력：演技；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연기력","audio":"/audio/029069de86431dd98b01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67481","senseId":"1","lemma":"연기력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인정받으면서","meaning":"受认可，被肯定，被承认","explanation":"인정받다：受认可，被肯定，被承认；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"인정받다","audio":"/audio/5c383c4bf54199aa98ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25088","senseId":"1","lemma":"인정받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인기가","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점점","meaning":"越来越","explanation":"점점：越来越","readings":[{"term":"점점","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70871","senseId":"1","lemma":"점점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라가고","meaning":"上升，升高","explanation":"올라가다：上升，升高；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"13","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"029069de86431dd9","term":"연기력","zh":"演技","audio":"/audio/029069de86431dd98b01.mp3","entryId":"67481","definition":"演员根据所担当的角色和情景表现人物、性格、行动等的能力。","pronunciation":["연ː기력"]},{"id":"5c383c4bf54199aa","term":"인정받다","zh":"受认可，被肯定，被承认","audio":"/audio/5c383c4bf54199aa98ac.mp3","entryId":"25088","definition":"某事物的价值或能力等被认为确实无疑。","pronunciation":["인정받따"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"2de57161655ba687","term":"점점","zh":"越来越","audio":"/audio/2de57161655ba687e8ee.mp3","entryId":"70871","definition":"程度随着时间的推移而逐渐地。","pronunciation":["점ː점"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上升，升高","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"气势、劲头、热情等渐渐变高。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3437aef90f39e979974.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70871","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.196,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近那个演员经常出现在广告里呢。","随着演技得到认可，他的人气也越来越高了。","你会来参加我的婚礼吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近那个演员经常出现在广告里呢。","随着演技得到认可，他的人气也越来越高了。","你会来参加我的婚礼吧？"],"answer":1}]}
